  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upscaling Conservation zones in Laos, Siphandone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment is about bridging the gaps between pilot nature-based solutions and taking them to scale. It aims to provide a worked-out scope of work, for implementing and incremental extension of the climate resilience work of the restoration and conservation works in the Siphandone Riverscape and Champasak Lower Mekong Plains.</narrative>
  </description>
